WEBVTT

00:12.490 --> 00:14.160
How many have I taken down now?

00:14.700 --> 00:15.830
Child Emperor said...

00:16.700 --> 00:19.250
He planned the attack,
so the enemy forces

00:19.290 --> 00:21.790
would be spread out
as much as possible, but...

00:25.960 --> 00:26.920
Yo!

00:34.510 --> 00:36.390
So you're Zombieman, huh?

00:36.600 --> 00:38.020
Then die already!

00:44.360 --> 00:46.070
Isn't this more than my share?

00:48.150 --> 00:52.660
I specialize in undercover ops, espionage,
and investigating contaminated zones.

00:52.700 --> 00:54.370
Fighting isn't exactly my strong suit.

00:54.530 --> 00:55.740
He's bleeding.

00:55.790 --> 00:57.700
Let's put this half-dead guy
out of his misery!

00:58.290 --> 00:59.120
Bring it on.

01:06.460 --> 01:08.840
Oh boy,
this is bone-breaking work...

01:08.960 --> 01:10.880
...literally.

01:12.970 --> 01:16.600
IMMORTAL BLOODBATH

01:19.020 --> 01:21.190
What's behind these doors?

01:21.980 --> 01:24.730
Whatever it is,
it's definitely not going to be good.

01:29.190 --> 01:31.740
I've been waiting forever, Hero.

01:34.160 --> 01:35.120
<i>A bat?</i>

01:42.330 --> 01:43.830
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
VAMPIRE (PUREBRED)

01:43.830 --> 01:46.420
-Kill each other!
-Don't finish it too quick.

01:46.500 --> 01:48.710
Good luck, Mr. Hero!

01:49.170 --> 01:53.470
Looks like they all want you to die.
What did you do to piss them off?

01:54.050 --> 01:57.220
You're all beasts,
so get along already.

01:57.850 --> 01:59.810
They're just trying to annoy me.

02:00.140 --> 02:04.690
It's jealousy. The talentless always
make the same mistake.

02:04.940 --> 02:08.230
They think a few petty tricks will
somehow close the gap between us.

02:08.360 --> 02:11.150
Start the deathmatch show!

02:11.280 --> 02:13.490
I'll have his innards.

02:13.650 --> 02:16.240
A Class-S hero
with high combat power.

02:16.530 --> 02:19.870
A vampire who feeds on monsters
and is hated by everyone.

02:20.540 --> 02:23.160
No matter which one dies,
it's good for us.

02:23.500 --> 02:25.500
A deathmatch between
two powerful fighters.

02:25.540 --> 02:28.380
Whoever survives won't be left
in one piece.

02:28.500 --> 02:31.260
And that's when we'll surround him
and rip him to pieces.

02:31.380 --> 02:33.760
So, you two go ahead and
get things started.

02:33.880 --> 02:36.220
Show us what you got,
both of you!

02:37.600 --> 02:40.930
Just ignore the noise.
I'll take care of them later.

02:41.060 --> 02:43.390
By the way, are you a Class-S hero?

02:43.730 --> 02:46.270
I'm not well-versed in worldly matters.
State your name!

02:46.560 --> 02:48.940
Apologies, I should've told you my name.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.650
Allow me to introduce myself...

02:53.740 --> 02:57.070
Both of them used surprise attacks,
but Vampire landed the first blow.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.240
This is awesome!

02:59.160 --> 03:00.030
This blood...

03:00.160 --> 03:03.500
is the worst I've ever tasted.
No way can I drink this.

03:03.540 --> 03:06.870
Hey, what's going on?
Is it over already, Mr. Hero?

03:06.870 --> 03:09.080
I bet he's the weakest in Class S.

03:09.170 --> 03:12.380
At least wear him down
a little before you die.

03:12.670 --> 03:13.670
-Oh?!
-Oh?!

03:14.630 --> 03:16.430
Hm? He's getting back up.

03:16.470 --> 03:18.340
I guess he wasn't drained
of all his blood?

03:18.390 --> 03:19.260
Nice!

03:25.100 --> 03:28.020
Trying to stand with
the last of your strength...

03:28.150 --> 03:29.310
Pathetic.

03:29.440 --> 03:32.650
But don't expect your unyielding
sense of justice to be rewarded.

03:32.900 --> 03:34.400
I am Vampire.

03:34.400 --> 03:38.570
The only true monster
in the Monster Association.

03:38.610 --> 03:41.740
A vampire with a bloodline carrying
supernatural powers for generations.

03:41.910 --> 03:45.580
Even after a brief fight,
the difference should be clear.

03:49.750 --> 03:50.710
Go to hell.

03:59.010 --> 04:01.100
Catching bullets is nothing special.

04:01.350 --> 04:02.600
Time to return the favor!

04:04.010 --> 04:05.850
That's what you call an easy win.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.850
Applause, please!

04:09.060 --> 04:12.230
No reaction?
You all have no manners!

04:14.230 --> 04:17.190
Huh? How are you still standing?

04:17.530 --> 04:22.240
Those bullets pierced your vital organs
and destroyed your brain.

04:22.490 --> 04:26.370
Before that, I ripped open
your carotid artery with my fangs.

04:26.410 --> 04:28.330
Has the bleeding already stopped?

04:28.870 --> 04:34.130
I've heard of this before.
A hero said to be immortal...

04:34.750 --> 04:36.260
Hmph, I see.

04:36.880 --> 04:39.510
These guys are fake monsters.

04:41.340 --> 04:44.350
And you're a fake human.

04:44.470 --> 04:45.310
Shut up.

04:48.060 --> 04:50.600
But your ability to regenerate...

04:50.730 --> 04:52.520
Is something you can be proud of.

05:12.170 --> 05:14.170
Let's have some more fun.

05:25.510 --> 05:28.600
Even among fakes, you're different
from the rest of the trash.

05:28.770 --> 05:30.850
You're kind of interesting!

05:31.350 --> 05:33.100
Whoa! It snapped.

05:39.150 --> 05:40.780
You slipped up!

05:44.490 --> 05:48.700
Don't think you're the only one
with regenerative powers.

05:53.500 --> 05:57.000
An inferior species that can't do
a thing without weapons.

05:57.290 --> 05:58.590
So don't get cocky!

05:59.460 --> 06:01.550
Even regeneration has its limits.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.430
Time to get torn to shreds!

06:11.810 --> 06:13.890
Whoa, back away from Vampire!

06:14.020 --> 06:15.850
He'll drain you dry
without thinking twice!

06:16.110 --> 06:18.570
I'm almost fully healed
after sucking on all this blood.

06:18.730 --> 06:22.240
Good thing I had a blood supply nearby.

06:22.570 --> 06:26.490
What about you?
You look more like a zombie now?

06:39.090 --> 06:42.880
I don't feel like moving...
but I guess I've got no choice.

06:44.590 --> 06:46.090
Hey, Vampire.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.760
This is going to be a bloodbath.
Brace yourself.

06:50.560 --> 06:53.390
30 MINUTES LATER

06:58.730 --> 07:02.230
I've killed you over and over...

07:03.320 --> 07:06.910
You should definitely be dead...yet...

07:07.200 --> 07:10.410
Yeah, you beat me about 200 times.

07:10.950 --> 07:12.790
Looks like I finally got my first win.

07:13.120 --> 07:15.580
Vampire lost to Zombieman?

07:16.670 --> 07:18.290
He's not moving. He's dead.

07:18.330 --> 07:22.380
There were so many ways to win.
What an idiot.

07:22.750 --> 07:26.930
It's been a while since
I fought such a tough monster.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.350
Oh man, I'm beat.

07:33.060 --> 07:34.310
He said he's tired.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.690
Hey, where do you think you're going?

07:37.020 --> 07:38.850
There's no time to rest.

07:38.980 --> 07:42.610
Next, you're taking on all of us.

07:47.570 --> 07:52.410
So there's about 30 of you?
No way I'd just run off like that.

07:52.620 --> 07:54.370
Huh? Is he for real?

07:55.080 --> 07:56.960
Your reckless fighting style
won't work on us!

07:56.960 --> 08:00.420
Pin him down! Attack him so fast that
he can't regenerate...

07:58.960 --> 08:04.170
PUNCH     DRAG     SCREAM

08:00.540 --> 08:02.500
-H-Hey, you go!
-No, you go...

08:10.430 --> 08:14.560
With these wounds, it'll probably
take a few minutes to fully heal.

08:20.150 --> 08:21.900
Time to take a break...

08:22.560 --> 08:24.150
I just wanna get this over with.

08:24.480 --> 08:27.950
I don't mind the blood...
but I hate sweating.

08:28.990 --> 08:30.280
<i>This is Child Emperor.</i>

08:30.410 --> 08:32.950
<i>I've secured Waganma and</i>
<i>we're heading to the surface.</i>

08:33.330 --> 08:35.830
<i>Everyone, lure the enemy away,</i>
<i>as planned.</i>

08:36.450 --> 08:39.750
<i>Don't be overeager in pursuing them.</i>
<i>The enemy is dangerous...</i>

08:41.290 --> 08:42.500
This is Zombieman.

08:43.250 --> 08:46.050
Thanks. We couldn't
have done it without you.

08:46.460 --> 08:48.130
Let me thank you
on everyone's behalf.

08:49.760 --> 08:51.180
He's doing a good job.

08:52.680 --> 08:53.890
Good, I'm all healed.

08:56.100 --> 08:58.140
Time to go kick some more butt.

08:59.640 --> 09:01.100
Finally, I've been waiting.

09:01.100 --> 09:03.650
Looks like this one's gonna
be a real feast!

09:03.770 --> 09:07.280
All of you are nothing
but food for Big-Eater.

09:07.820 --> 09:11.950
I'm the monster with an endless appetite
that devours everything!

09:12.410 --> 09:16.620
I'll swallow all the heroes whole!

09:19.120 --> 09:21.370
That sounds like quite a fight.

09:21.870 --> 09:23.920
But if it's a Class-S hero,
they should be fine.

09:24.590 --> 09:26.920
We need to focus on our own battles.

09:27.670 --> 09:30.170
Master gave us permission
to go off on our own.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.010
We must not let him down.

09:42.600 --> 09:45.770
They're a private rescue squad
deployed by Mr. Narinki.

09:46.440 --> 09:48.110
Looks like they've been brainwashed.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.190
We'll subdue them without hurting them.

09:50.190 --> 09:51.280
Okay!

09:51.400 --> 09:52.530
Understood.

09:54.910 --> 09:58.660
Here's another bunch of clueless fools
that I can mold to my liking.

09:59.750 --> 10:03.080
Come on you guys,
now's the time to serve me.

10:11.340 --> 10:12.920
How to deal with guns?

10:13.680 --> 10:17.640
Come on, that bullet's even slower
than my sword.

10:20.020 --> 10:21.350
I can go faster.

10:27.110 --> 10:28.400
First, destroy their weapons.

10:28.860 --> 10:32.360
Next, disable their battle suits.
Aim for their elbows and knee joints.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.320
Roger that!

10:42.370 --> 10:44.040
Not as easy as I hoped...

10:44.250 --> 10:46.080
Come on! Go! Go!

10:46.210 --> 10:48.500
Welcome your new comrades!

10:48.880 --> 10:51.880
That monster is
messing with their minds.

10:53.720 --> 10:55.630
Snap out of it!

10:57.800 --> 10:59.720
It's no use trying to persuade them.

11:03.020 --> 11:04.940
Such tremendous strength.

11:05.520 --> 11:06.520
However...

11:10.400 --> 11:13.940
A blade without will is
nothing to be feared!

11:17.110 --> 11:19.450
They're strong enough to be a problem...

11:20.080 --> 11:22.540
How should we deal with this now?

11:22.790 --> 11:26.920
If I attack them from beyond their reach,
they should be helpless.

11:27.370 --> 11:28.250
Right?

11:31.960 --> 11:32.840
Right.

11:35.220 --> 11:37.550
Those are unauthorized
battle suits obtained illegally.

11:37.930 --> 11:39.550
They've got solid martial arts skills.

11:39.720 --> 11:42.350
Keep dodging and
throw off their rhythm!

11:43.720 --> 11:45.310
How cute,
you have so many openings.

11:45.600 --> 11:49.310
Now I will seize
my first new love slave!

11:52.070 --> 11:53.020
With his bare hand?

11:54.070 --> 11:55.280
What the—? Who is it...?!

11:55.940 --> 11:57.150
Amai Mask!!

11:57.900 --> 12:00.450
She's using this whip to
control her underlings.

12:01.370 --> 12:03.290
Probably some kind of
pain-induced hypnosis...

12:04.080 --> 12:06.250
If you get struck by it,
you might lose your willpower.

12:07.250 --> 12:08.790
You guys are at a disadvantage here.

12:09.210 --> 12:10.960
Leave this to me and
fight somewhere else.

12:12.210 --> 12:16.590
I won't get into details,
but I have a simple solution.

12:17.720 --> 12:19.010
Not to worry.

12:19.340 --> 12:21.340
I'm not so weak
as to be brainwashed.

12:21.600 --> 12:23.720
For now, let's trust the superstar.

12:25.930 --> 12:28.230
All right... We're counting on you.

12:31.610 --> 12:32.810
Oh my...

12:33.360 --> 12:36.400
Staying behind alone in this situation?
Are you out of your mind?

12:36.900 --> 12:40.070
Heroes who think like that
are only a burden.

12:40.780 --> 12:44.080
Just as I thought, you're gorgeous.

12:44.790 --> 12:46.240
I'm so happy we met.

12:46.910 --> 12:50.710
Just between you and me...
I've actually been a fan of yours.

12:51.370 --> 12:52.920
So how about it?

12:53.040 --> 12:55.300
Want to sneak off somewhere
and get nice and cozy?

13:00.970 --> 13:04.680
Then just maybe I'll free
them from my control.

13:05.220 --> 13:08.480
Do you really think
I'd agree to such a deal?

13:08.520 --> 13:10.350
You wretched monster!

13:10.600 --> 13:12.060
Brace yourself!

13:13.150 --> 13:15.730
That's mean, Amai Mask.

13:16.400 --> 13:18.360
I'm gonna make you mine,
no matter what.

13:20.150 --> 13:21.400
Something feels off...

13:21.860 --> 13:24.240
What kind of solution
is he talking about?

13:24.530 --> 13:25.660
I don't know.

13:25.780 --> 13:27.240
But he seemed super confident.

13:27.370 --> 13:29.960
He must have a trump card
he doesn't want to show anyone.

13:30.210 --> 13:33.460
He might break the brainwashing by
whipping out a mic

13:33.460 --> 13:35.460
and doing a little musical number.

13:35.790 --> 13:38.170
You expect way too much from idols.

13:39.090 --> 13:40.760
<i>To be a hero...</i>

13:41.010 --> 13:43.180
<i>To be a champion of justice...</i>

13:43.840 --> 13:45.510
<i>evil must be struck down.</i>

13:47.810 --> 13:49.140
Without any hesitation...

13:49.270 --> 13:51.480
Are you really that Amai Mask?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.440
Damn it!

13:56.110 --> 13:58.110
My whip’s useless?!

13:58.230 --> 14:00.650
W-Wait! I surrender!

14:03.280 --> 14:06.030
I am at your command.
Master Amai Mask.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.660
Y-You're not human...!

14:11.910 --> 14:14.210
Monsters must die.

14:16.670 --> 14:18.210
What's that sound?

14:18.840 --> 14:20.170
Th-That's...a monster?!

14:20.300 --> 14:22.760
No, maybe Pig God?

14:23.340 --> 14:24.590
What's going on with that?

14:24.720 --> 14:26.260
How does he digest all that?

14:26.720 --> 14:27.760
No idea.

14:28.010 --> 14:30.770
But it feels like
we've seen something we shouldn't have.

14:31.520 --> 14:34.310
Yeah... Let's go a different way...

14:35.400 --> 14:36.610
There's something down below!

14:47.490 --> 14:49.700
Like a moth to a flame.

14:50.240 --> 14:53.120
Heroes of justice diving in
and getting tangled in my hair.

14:52.370 --> 14:53.910
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MALONG HAIR

14:54.330 --> 14:55.290
A monster...

14:55.670 --> 14:59.380
<i>He's so hot.</i>
<i>He's seducing me.</i>

14:59.920 --> 15:00.750
<i>But I cannot.</i>

15:01.130 --> 15:03.090
<i>He's a monster and I'm a hero.</i>

15:03.420 --> 15:05.470
<i>It's forbidden love.</i>

15:06.010 --> 15:08.800
Hey, the enemy's ability is unknown.

15:09.470 --> 15:11.220
Test him with your Flying Sword.

15:12.310 --> 15:14.520
This fool's falling for a monster again.

15:14.810 --> 15:16.480
Snap out of it, you idiot.

15:16.770 --> 15:18.150
Who are you calling an idiot?

15:18.520 --> 15:20.940
Oh, I get it. You're jealous.

15:21.070 --> 15:22.110
Huh? Can I cut you?

15:22.230 --> 15:23.530
No. Calm down!

15:23.740 --> 15:25.320
This is no time to be fooling around.

15:25.320 --> 15:27.910
Even while we stand here,
battles are raging everywhere.

15:30.580 --> 15:34.830
It's our duty to ease the burden
on Master and the others.

15:35.160 --> 15:38.670
All right. He's a hottie,
but so be it.

15:39.130 --> 15:40.380
I'm sorry.

15:40.710 --> 15:44.340
But I can't reciprocate your feelings.

15:44.460 --> 15:46.930
That came out of nowhere.
I just got dumped.

15:48.010 --> 15:49.090
Flying Sword.

15:53.850 --> 15:57.640
<i>Slicing through the air</i>
<i>creates giant whirlwinds.</i>

15:57.940 --> 16:00.230
<i>I hate to admit it,</i>
<i>but it's a technique I cannot imitate.</i>

16:00.520 --> 16:02.860
A frog in a well knows nothing
of the great ocean.

16:03.360 --> 16:06.190
Class-A heroes know nothing
of the terrors of my hair.

16:07.400 --> 16:10.240
<i>Impossible! He blocked</i>
<i>Flying Sword with his long hair.</i>

16:10.490 --> 16:12.200
<i>And what he said wasn't even clever!</i>

16:14.870 --> 16:16.580
Hey! Behind you! Underground!

16:21.960 --> 16:23.840
Th-Thanks.

16:24.920 --> 16:25.880
What a pain.

16:26.300 --> 16:28.010
The enemy's weapon is his hair.

16:28.430 --> 16:29.930
Since they're thinner than blades

16:29.930 --> 16:32.050
they slip easily through the gaps
in bones and armor.

16:32.470 --> 16:34.220
Don't overlook even a single strand.

16:34.810 --> 16:37.560
His attack methods likely include
more than just piercing.

16:37.680 --> 16:41.020
He can probably bind, constrict,
throw, or slice with his hair.

16:42.940 --> 16:44.440
Like salt on fresh greens

16:44.440 --> 16:46.320
my long hair will drain
the life out of you.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.490
Don't use your eyes!

16:56.200 --> 16:59.330
Use your reflexes to counter
the hair's killing intent.

16:59.410 --> 17:01.080
Like water on a burnt stone...

17:01.080 --> 17:02.750
Fighting long hair with swords is futile.

17:03.880 --> 17:05.710
Letting anything through
will get us killed.

17:05.710 --> 17:06.840
Intercept every attack.

17:06.960 --> 17:09.260
The human head has over
a hundred thousand hairs.

17:09.590 --> 17:11.180
Yet we only have three swords.

17:11.300 --> 17:12.680
This is gonna wear on our nerves.

17:12.800 --> 17:13.800
Here he comes!

17:18.640 --> 17:19.850
Damn it, I'm tangled up.

17:19.930 --> 17:21.730
Like a candle in the wind...

17:21.850 --> 17:23.440
Your lives are about to go out.

17:23.980 --> 17:26.270
Hmph. He has the worst lines.

17:26.730 --> 17:29.360
Don't worry.
As long as he comes into range

17:29.400 --> 17:31.450
I can break his defense
and cut him clean in half.

17:31.450 --> 17:33.240
One hundred thousand?
Bring it on!

17:33.360 --> 17:35.620
I'll slice and shred every last one!

17:45.790 --> 17:48.420
<i>What would Master do</i>
<i>at a time like this...?</i>

17:49.960 --> 17:54.510
<i>What's your take on</i>
<i>Shibabawa's Earthdoom prophecy?</i>

17:55.220 --> 17:58.770
<i>Hm? I suspect it's not the end yet.</i>

17:59.220 --> 18:01.230
<i>Something has been bothering me</i>
<i>this whole time.</i>

18:01.850 --> 18:03.980
<i>What if,</i>
<i>within this Monster Association</i>

18:04.560 --> 18:06.820
<i>there exists an unbelievably</i>
<i>dangerous being...</i>

18:07.860 --> 18:10.940
<i>A monster that</i>
<i>no human could ever defeat</i>

18:10.990 --> 18:13.570
<i>a being that embodies despair itself.</i>

18:14.820 --> 18:16.780
<i>What would you do, Master?</i>

18:23.330 --> 18:25.960
<i>Then I'd have to surpass being human.</i>

18:26.630 --> 18:28.500
<i>That's what Master said, but...</i>

18:28.750 --> 18:31.170
<i>But Class-S heroes like Master,</i>
<i>Tornado and Pig God</i>

18:31.300 --> 18:33.510
<i>have already gone beyond human limits.</i>

18:34.010 --> 18:37.300
<i>We still have a ways to go,</i>
<i>but at least</i>

18:37.550 --> 18:39.220
<i>we'll cling on and</i>
<i>keep pushing forward.</i>

18:48.230 --> 18:50.070
My Achilles' heel is....

18:51.030 --> 18:52.740
My hair.

18:55.820 --> 18:57.410
We...won?

18:57.910 --> 19:01.580
All we did was keep hacking at
the hair that was attacking us.

19:02.040 --> 19:04.620
Oh man...
He was a terrifying opponent

19:04.750 --> 19:07.580
with his relentless attacks
and incredible reach.

19:09.670 --> 19:11.750
It took all three of us
to bring him down.

19:12.210 --> 19:14.470
Are there more like him?

19:15.300 --> 19:18.180
The remaining monsters are
gonna be pretty tough as well.

19:18.510 --> 19:21.010
Yeah. There's no time to rest.

19:21.390 --> 19:23.770
Although I'm sure Master
isn't having any problems.

19:36.990 --> 19:40.240
Luring them in and slashing them
all down with a single swing.

19:40.370 --> 19:43.330
You are indeed a great swordsman,
Atomic Samurai.

19:44.500 --> 19:47.000
Did someone escape my blade?

19:47.460 --> 19:50.080
I offered my soul to my blade
and became

19:50.210 --> 19:52.170
the Sword Demon Chopper-Upper.

19:52.380 --> 19:55.090
I will feast on your blood
and charge forward

19:55.090 --> 19:56.970
on the path to unrivaled supremacy!

20:00.350 --> 20:01.390
We're even...

20:01.640 --> 20:02.680
Even...

20:03.310 --> 20:04.270
All right then.

20:04.390 --> 20:08.390
Is this everyone? Raise your hand
if you didn't get slashed.

20:10.520 --> 20:11.980
I am Machine God G5.

20:12.440 --> 20:15.440
I have obtained your combat data.

20:15.940 --> 20:19.320
I have completely copied
your sword skills.

20:19.820 --> 20:23.450
Stop your futile resistance
and offer up your neck.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.120
Tsk.

20:30.790 --> 20:31.750
I'm surprised.

20:32.170 --> 20:37.130
Toys these days are so well-made.
I should order one online.

20:37.550 --> 20:39.340
Your bravado won't last.

20:40.090 --> 20:42.720
I will gradually increase
my attack speed.

20:42.930 --> 20:44.600
You're making me yawn.

20:45.180 --> 20:47.230
Crank up your performance.

20:47.430 --> 20:50.690
I thought my disciples could
at least practice on you, but...

20:51.350 --> 20:53.230
You are mistaken.

20:53.650 --> 20:56.610
My true strength isn't just
about copying your techniques

20:56.730 --> 20:57.900
it's upgrading them.

20:58.280 --> 21:00.820
As a robot, I can create
unknown sword techniques

21:00.820 --> 21:03.950
that defy the limitations
of human joint mobility.

21:04.490 --> 21:07.950
Virtual combat calculations complete.
Maximum speed!

21:10.540 --> 21:12.500
Atomic Slash Two-Blade Style.

21:18.090 --> 21:19.970
Nothing but a cheap knockoff, huh?

21:25.260 --> 21:28.600
<i>There's something especially hard</i>
<i>embedded in the core.</i>

21:28.810 --> 21:30.600
<i>There were parts</i>
<i>I couldn't slice through.</i>

21:32.560 --> 21:34.310
A weasel's last gasp, huh?

21:34.440 --> 21:36.150
You just don't know when to quit.

21:38.780 --> 21:40.450
Damn it. He got away.

21:41.030 --> 21:42.910
I'll have the surface team
take care of it.

21:42.990 --> 21:44.990
They're quite skilled too.

21:45.700 --> 21:50.040
In fact, their impromptu teamwork
may even be better than ours...

21:50.330 --> 21:52.620
Help! Help!

21:53.000 --> 21:55.040
Help! Someone help me!

21:55.710 --> 21:56.670
Stop!

21:57.250 --> 22:04.260
STOMP STOMP

21:57.800 --> 21:59.800
Hey, kid. Hey, stop.

22:00.590 --> 22:03.470
I'm not gonna do anything to you.
I'm just gonna kill you.

22:03.970 --> 22:05.800
I'll make it fast.
It'll be over in a flash.

22:12.940 --> 22:15.440
Well, well... You've got moves.

22:16.900 --> 22:20.030
Are you trying to pick a fight with me?

23:55.960 --> 24:00.960
TOP DRAGONS
